<body>
    <h1>Data Domains and Ownership</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h2 id=3D"DataDomainsandOwnership-Purpose">Purpose</h2>
<p>One of the Principles of Data Governance is that enterprise data doesn't=
 "belong" to individuals. It is an asset that belongs to the enterprise. Ho=
wever, it still needs to be <strong>managed</strong>,</p>
<p>Having Data ownership defined in AZP acknowledges that AZP data is "owne=
d" by the organization rather than individuals or silos with in the enterpr=
ise.,&nbsp;</p>
<p>However, accountabilities for working with that data must be assigned to=
 roles in the organization, and individuals (or teams) fill these roles. Ha=
ving designated <strong>Business Data Owners</strong> can help in coordinat=
ing these accountabilities.</p>
<p>Data Ownership is crucial to know..</p>
<ul>
 <li>Where does the data <em>originate </em>and who <em>uses </em>it?</li>
 <li>Is there <em>accountability at each stage </em>of the data journey?</l=
i>
 <li>Is everyone clear on their <em>roles and responsibilities</em>?</li>
 <li>Is there a clear understanding of the <em>business rules and quality s=
tandards</em>?</li>
 <li>What is the process to <em>resolve data issues</em>? Which teams get i=
nvolved?</li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"DataDomainsandOwnership-AFRDATARequirements">AFRDATA Requirements=
&nbsp;</h2>
<p>As part of AFRDATA compliance, it is mandatory to have Data Ownership de=
fined within AZP.</p>
<p>AZP Data Owners will work with <span style=3D"color:#c9372c;"><span styl=
e=3D"color:#172b4d;">AZP Data Office</span> </span>to:</p>
<ul>
 <li>Define, update and publish AZP Business Glossary. AZP Business Glossar=
y must be adopted and extended from Global Business Glossary.</li>
 <li>Provide data requirements to AZP Data Office to implement a Data Catal=
og for AZP relevant use cases (including relevant global use cases).</li>
 <li><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Authorize access to their respective da=
ta sets for data sharing.</span></li>
</ul>
<p>Data Requirements must consist of:</p>
<ul>
 <li>Data Privacy requirements in line with AFRIS and APS including guidanc=
e for data anonymization/ pseudonymization.</li>
 <li>Data Quality requirements for core data&nbsp;</li>
 <li>End to end business and technical lineage for core data.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"DataDomainsandOwnership-Acronyms/Definitions">Acronyms/ Definitio=
ns</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <colgroup>
   <col>
   <col>
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Acronym</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Definition</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">AZP</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Allianz Personal Lines UK</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">AZH</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Allianz Holdings UK</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">AFRDATA</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Allianz Functional Rule for Core Data Handli=
ng</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">AFRIS</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Allianz Functional Rule of Information Secur=
ity</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">APS</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Allianz Privacy Standard</td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"DataDomainsandOwnership-DomainDrivenOwnership">Domain Driven Owne=
rship</h2>
<p>AZP have looked at organizing data ownership based on Data domains.&nbsp=
;</p>
<p>Data Domains are high level logical grouping of data based on items of O=
rganization interest to or within the organization. For e.g.: Customer, Pro=
duct/Service. Location etc.&nbsp;Leveraged to organize the business as per =
areas of expertise and management.</p>
<p>These can go across business units and systems. They can have different =
stakeholders. <strong>Each domain is owned by an Exec Business Data Owner. =
</strong>This provides cross domain steer for decision making and an escala=
tion path.</p>
<h3 id=3D"DataDomainsandOwnership-Benefits">Benefits</h3>
<p>Domain driven ownership provides means to manage the organization of dat=
a and the ownership (Inc. stewardship) for effective decision making and pr=
oblem solving. This decision making benefits to:</p>
<ul>
 <li>Extract <strong>maximum value</strong> from data assets.</li>
 <li><strong>Reduce cost by avoiding waste</strong> due to poorly defined q=
uality of data.</li>
 <li>Comply to <strong>Pricing technical excellence requirement </strong>of=
 data ownership for pricing function.</li>
 <li>
  <p>Identify personal data as part of business glossary classification and=
 data catalog for <strong>data protection</strong>.</p></li>
 <li>
  <p>Implement AZP obligations for <strong>Allianz group data standards</st=
rong>.</p></li>
 <li>
  <p>Enable <strong>better decision making </strong>by improving quality an=
d understanding of our data.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"DataDomainsandOwnership-DomainType"><span>Domain Type&nbsp;</span=
></h2>
<p>Domain types are determined based on the categories of data stakeholders=
.</p>
<p>Domain types can be of Data Consumer, Producer or both.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 47=
.6914%;">
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 13.4752%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 41.7258%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 44.7991%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Domain Type</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Responsibilities</th>
    <th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh"><a href=3D"https://confluence.=
group.net/display/GIBP/Data+Capability" rel=3D"nofollow">Data Capability le=
vel</a></th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Data Consumers</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li>Define Information assets</li>
      <li>Define data and business terms for the Information assets</li>
      <li>Responsible for specifying data quality requirements</li>
      <li>Ensure data is fit for purpose for the defined information assets=
.</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Data Consumer</p>
     <p>Data Interpreter</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Data Producers</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li>Ensure data produced can be used as per consumer needs.</li>
      <li>Ensure data quality is implemented as per consumer specification.=
</li>
      <li>Define processes to monitor data quality within their domain</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">Data Interrogator</td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<p>For combined Domain types:</p>
<ul>
 <li>As a data producer, ensure the responsibilities of consuming domains a=
re met.</li>
 <li>As a data consumer, ensure the definitions are in place for the produc=
ing domains.</li>
</ul>
